    {
      "source": "Returns all <a href=\"Part.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part</code></a>s of the <a href=\"PartTree.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree</code></a> of the given <a href=\"Part.Type.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part.Type</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回给定<a href=\"Part.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part</code></a>的<a href=\"PartTree.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree</code></a>中的所有<a href=\"Part.Type.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part.Type</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"PartTree.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree</code></a> by parsing the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>.",
      "translation": "通过解析给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>创建一个新的<a href=\"PartTree.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser 中的类\"><code>PartTree</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> of all parts contained in the <a href=\"PartTree.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个包含 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>Iterable</code></a> 的迭代器，该迭代器包含所有位于 <a href=\"PartTree.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser 中的类\"><code>PartTree</code></a> 中的部分。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the <a href=\"PartTree.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree</code></a> contains predicate <a href=\"Part.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "返回 <a href=\"PartTree.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser 中的类\"><code>PartTree</code></a> 是否包含谓词 <a href=\"Part.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser 中的类\"><code>Part</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the number of maximal results to return or <a href=\"../../../domain/Limit.html#unlimited()\"><code>Limit.unlimited()</code></a> if not restricted.",
      "translation": "返回要返回的最大结果数量，或如果不受限制则返回<a href=\"../../../domain/Limit.html#unlimited()\"><code>Limit.unlimited()</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> specification parsed from the source.",
      "translation": "返回从源解析出的<a href=\"../../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>规范。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "return true if the created <a href=\"PartTree.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree</code></a> is meant to be used for delete operation.",
      "translation": "如果创建的<a href=\"PartTree.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser 中的类\"><code>PartTree</code></a>旨在用于删除操作，则返回 true。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Return true if the create <a href=\"PartTree.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree</code></a> is meant to be used for a query with limited maximal results.",
      "translation": "如果创建<a href=\"PartTree.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser 中的类\"><code>PartTree</code></a>的目的是用于限制最大结果数的查询，则返回 true。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the number of maximal results to return or null if not restricted.",
      "translation": "返回要返回的最大结果数量，若未限制则返回 null。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether a count projection shall be applied.",
      "translation": "返回是否应应用计数投影。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether we indicate distinct lookup of entities.",
      "translation": "返回是否指示对实体进行独立查找。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether an exists projection shall be applied.",
      "translation": "返回是否应应用存在的投影。",
      "count": 3
