    {
      "source": "Class to parse a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> into a tree or <a href=\"PartTree.OrPart.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree.OrPart</code></a>s consisting of simple <a href=\"Part.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part</code></a> instances in turn.\nTakes a domain class as well to validate that each of the <a href=\"Part.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part</code></a>s are referring to a property of the domain\nclass. The <a href=\"PartTree.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree</code></a> can then be used to build queries based on its API instead of parsing the method name for\neach query execution.",
      "translation": "用于将 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>` 解析为由简单的 <a href=\"Part.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part</code></a> 实例组成的树或 <a href=\"PartTree.OrPart.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree.OrPart</code></a>。该方法还需要一个领域类，以验证每个 <a href=\"Part.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>Part</code></a> 是否引用了该领域类的属性。随后，可以利用 <a href=\"PartTree.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree</code></a> 的 API 来构建查询，而无需在每次查询执行时解析方法名。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A part of the parsed source that results from splitting up the resource around Or keywords.",
      "translation": "由围绕 Or 关键字拆分资源所得到的解析源的一部分。",
      "count": 2
    },
